    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227480/extras/cd3d6ab4fc36c11fb44354523168db92.avif?t=1725089365\" /></div><br><strong>Space Academy</strong> is a colorful Platformer featuring an inexperienced pilot getting ready to take his journey in the academy to study all the necessary skills. <br>Play a breathtaking campaign and uncover all the secrets the academy has hidden from recruits.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227480/extras/8deeebb04a0889a4f6e3b0a4b6c4bce6.poster.avif?t=1725089365\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227480/extras/8deeebb04a0889a4f6e3b0a4b6c4bce6.webm?t=1725089365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227480/extras/8deeebb04a0889a4f6e3b0a4b6c4bce6.mp4?t=1725089365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Go to the Academy filled with many different traps and obstacles.<br>Platformer in which you will find everything - difficult levels, nice minimalist 3D graphics, unusual characters, dungeons and many more.<br><br>Accept the challenge - go through all the levels and pass the one final exam at the academy.<br>But I forgot to mention that you don't have any superpowers - you're just a newbie pilot in an academy with a strict but experienced leutenant. Good luck<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227480/extras/ff0da1e59040a3a5fbdc87bb133c3ad8.poster.avif?t=1725089365\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227480/extras/ff0da1e59040a3a5fbdc87bb133c3ad8.webm?t=1725089365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227480/extras/ff0da1e59040a3a5fbdc87bb133c3ad8.mp4?t=1725089365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>And Experience the endless mode with random generation, which will help you to practice for the final exam in the academy.<br><br><strong>Game Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Many levels filled with dangerous traps and different machines<br></li><li> A real challenge for your abilities<br></li><li> Nice minimalist graphics <br></li><li> Gamepad support</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227480/extras/3ec236cfc1a7792db192c949d7fba19c.poster.avif?t=1725089365\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227480/extras/3ec236cfc1a7792db192c949d7fba19c.webm?t=1725089365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227480/extras/3ec236cfc1a7792db192c949d7fba19c.mp4?t=1725089365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227480/extras/cd3d6ab4fc36c11fb44354523168db92.avif?t=1725089365\" /></div><br><strong>Space Academy</strong> is a colorful Platformer featuring an inexperienced pilot getting ready to take his journey in the academy to study all the necessary skills. <br>Play a breathtaking campaign and uncover all the secrets the academy has hidden from recruits.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227480/extras/8deeebb04a0889a4f6e3b0a4b6c4bce6.poster.avif?t=1725089365\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227480/extras/8deeebb04a0889a4f6e3b0a4b6c4bce6.webm?t=1725089365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227480/extras/8deeebb04a0889a4f6e3b0a4b6c4bce6.mp4?t=1725089365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Go to the Academy filled with many different traps and obstacles.<br>Platformer in which you will find everything - difficult levels, nice minimalist 3D graphics, unusual characters, dungeons and many more.<br><br>Accept the challenge - go through all the levels and pass the one final exam at the academy.<br>But I forgot to mention that you don't have any superpowers - you're just a newbie pilot in an academy with a strict but experienced leutenant. Good luck<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227480/extras/ff0da1e59040a3a5fbdc87bb133c3ad8.poster.avif?t=1725089365\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227480/extras/ff0da1e59040a3a5fbdc87bb133c3ad8.webm?t=1725089365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227480/extras/ff0da1e59040a3a5fbdc87bb133c3ad8.mp4?t=1725089365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>And Experience the endless mode with random generation, which will help you to practice for the final exam in the academy.<br><br><strong>Game Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Many levels filled with dangerous traps and different machines<br></li><li> A real challenge for your abilities<br></li><li> Nice minimalist graphics <br></li><li> Gamepad support</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227480/extras/3ec236cfc1a7792db192c949d7fba19c.poster.avif?t=1725089365\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227480/extras/3ec236cfc1a7792db192c949d7fba19c.webm?t=1725089365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227480/extras/3ec236cfc1a7792db192c949d7fba19c.mp4?t=1725089365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
